/E (edges so it would glide along the door when forcing it closed. The door and hinge was made to sit within the face of the container holder when closed so the switch on the motor would not hit the hinge when sliding over the door or meet any other kind of interference which would stop it from closing the trapdoor. All together, the switch, trapdoor, and hinge pin would be 3D printed.)
