/T (      Due to several mechanical design changes, testing errors, and 3D printing errors, the project timeline was changed. The design phase lasted longer than initially expected, due to mechanical redesigns of the robot. In the chart above, the coding timeline ranged from October 28 - November 11. However, the code was actually modified from around October 11 - November 20. Additionally, the robot was tested for each change that occurred between October 15 - November 20. The 3D printing took longer than planned \(and was not included in the original Gantt chart\) due to issues with available 3D printers, and the print failing twice from not having enough supports for the print.)
