977 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (      Another factor of suitability for the home is the material with which the slide and trapdoor are made. Since they are currently made of PLA, these components are not dishwasher safe [2] which would make cleaning them harder, and not always 100% food safe which could harm the pets. Therefore, using a material like plastic would fix these problems, leading to a safer robot for the pets and a more convenient robot for the pet owner.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
