>>
endobj
979 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (      If more time were available, the software could be improved by enhancing the color detection, for example, by averaging the hues to reduce misreads. The timed movements in both the afterDetection and releaseFood functions should be replaced with more precise methods such as using encoder counts and load measurements to improve consistency and accuracy. For industry applications, implementing error handling functions such as timeouts or sensor fault detection, would improve reliability. Adding a remote-controlled or automated start function would also increase versatility. Overall, these changes would enhance the accuracy and reliability of the robot.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
